# The test suite byte-compares the samples/*.edi fixtures and
# X12Lens.Tests/expected-inspect-850.txt against parser and CLI output, so line
# endings are load-bearing here rather than cosmetic.
#
# Without this file, Git's autocrlf converts them to CRLF on a Windows checkout
# while Linux CI checks out LF. CI would stay green while a fresh Windows clone
# failed, which is the worst shape a test failure can take. Pinning LF matches
# both CI and the working tree these 86 tests were verified against.
* text=auto eol=lf
